{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1765152000, "end_date": 1765843199, "month_true_total": 119, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:56:07 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "213336521", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969854476", "personaname": "Krokodile", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969854476/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 5878, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1887, "last_played": 1768628762, "avatar": "8c368053adeec6af5e3cf4fd48d85d11a10526fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fan-Freaking-Tastic!!! RoboQuest is a fast, rogue-lite shooter with good sense of humor. It's got lots of guns, lots of perks, good difficulty and difficulty progression as you unlock harder modes, good music, and a lot of things to collect/unlock/research. This is exactly what a fast shooter should feel like! 10/10, will play again!", "timestamp_created": 1765781543, "timestamp_updated": 1765781543, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213242221", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010551022", "personaname": "Scarecrow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/uhCrow/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 54, "playtime_at_review": 733, "last_played": 1790358785, "avatar": "b6f980a78a3bf09516f2644893da500f5c4da7e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1765675782, "timestamp_updated": 1765675782, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213233238", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165593260", "personaname": "J0RD4NR05E", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165593260/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3455, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 23, "playtime_at_review": 1391, "last_played": 1790226184, "avatar": "02e783ab1a4ff914833d9c8c54da19a07641470f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game. simple. rougelike. smooth performance. excellent game design. Relaxing and intense at the same time", "timestamp_created": 1765665288, "timestamp_updated": 1765665288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213220218", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144409177", "personaname": "Runaway", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/azaza_mazafaka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1278, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 201, "last_played": 1777918546, "avatar": "edfdb5ecfdb7235eccd180d3d58b8df70d5b251f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Maybe I misunderstood something, but the game has a rogue-like feel to it, yet after each loss, the levels don't change, and neither do the characters.\nBecause of this, the gameplay becomes monotonous, even with friends — at some point, you get stuck in one place and it's hard to move forward: the map suddenly expands, the number of enemies increases (if we compare the first two dungeons we reached).\n\nFrom an FPS perspective, it's interesting and lively, with lots of mechanics and room to level up, but the complicated parkour (which is mandatory for some objectives in the game) spoils the experience.\n\nIs it worth the money? I don't think so.\nWill there be fans? Definitely yes.\nWould I recommend it? No.\n\nMaybe I'm missing something, so I'll wait for your comments.", "timestamp_created": 1765653312, "timestamp_updated": 1765653312, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.465290486812591553", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213214599", "author": {"steamid": "76561198149167786", "personaname": "Mu Alexius", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198149167786/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 7147, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5360, "last_played": 1766622504, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game", "timestamp_created": 1765648399, "timestamp_updated": 1765648399, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}